methods=f'''# Actual methods: scoped frozen K32 reference identifiability

## Scope and frozen identities
The user explicitly authorized a derived reference excluding 18182 old Epithelial members outside the frozen discovery range. Original v5 BLOCKED records were preserved. All 158152 other old-subtype cells and all 123699 frozen epithelial-analysis cells are retained: 281851 unique cells, 31 labels. Frozen K32=C18 of FULL_Z_r1.00 has 3282 members; Epi_other has120417. Exact old reference cell_id sets retain legitimate Cycling-origin cells; no major==Epithelial filter was applied. Epi_other replaces the old audit-only name Epi_rest and is not MP10-low. Exclusion reason is outside_frozen_discovery_scope; 18120 early-cleaning specific reasons remain UNVERIFIED, while62 small-cluster exclusions retain the documented stage. Excluded cells were not used as state-negative truth.

## Source isolation
Original v5 assignment is reused without new random splitting:25/8/8 conservative TRAIN/DEV/TEST groups, with2395/634/253 K32. Groups are not independently verified patients. Name-based N/T, BC/NC and Inhouse a/b bundles are retained, including conservative PRJNA P2/P6 linkage for naming ambiguity. P07T and P07N remain TRAIN. All31 subtypes have real TRAIN support; minimum subtype support146 cells in both branches. MAIN135860 cells, NO_P07T131630 cells; only exact CNP0000460|CNP0000460_P07T removed in NO_P07T. K32 TRAIN counts2395 and934 respectively. No sample-balanced or class-balanced downsampling.

## Raw counts and genes
The raw minimally harmonized AnnData source and prior counts audit were reused after SHA256 verification. The reference scope-dependent permissive filter was recalculated only on scoped MAIN TRAIN: n_detected>0.03*n_TRAIN OR (n_detected>5 AND nonzero_mean>1.12). Existing authoritative HGNC/Ensembl exact/previous-symbol mapping and documented sum collapses were retained; no fuzzy matching or normalized counts were used. Final11230 genes are TRAIN-filtered, identity-resolved, non-MT and present in all63 eligible actual Visium feature lists. MAIN and NO_P07T use identical gene and label order; The common rule would remove zero-after-P07T genes from both branches; the actual number requiring such removal was0. Spatial features and QC were read only. Nine of eleven fixed support genes are retained. HSD17B7 is present in4/63 eligible feature lists and HMGCS1 in62/63, so neither enters the strict shared-gene model; this limits interpretation of their roles. Exact source-feature mapping retains544 of700 frozen MP top50 program entries, with per-input detail exported. MT- genes are excluded; InhouseData mitochondrial proportion remains NOT_RELIABLY_EVALUABLE, with no membership changes based on its zero MT counts.

## NB reference
cell2location RegressionModel, labels_key=new_reference_label, batch_key=sample (dataset|orig.ident), no additional covariates. Both references estimate all31 signatures from their own TRAIN cells; no old full-data signature is reused. GPU scheduling follows the explicit resource-aware concurrency authorization in RUNTIME_CONCURRENCY_OVERRIDE.md; batch_size2500, train_size1, lr0.002, initial250epochs, extensions125 to cap1000. The prespecified technical stopping diagnostic is absolute relative change between final50 and preceding50 epoch mean negative ELBO<0.01. Each segment creates a model checkpoint and combined history. Actual epoch totals and convergence flags are in model_index.tsv. Posterior1000 draws of required global parameters are summarized without saving all latent draws. Gene×subtype means are scaled by cell-weighted average detection_mean_y_e, matching the old mean detection_y_c export convention. Reconstruction compares expected and observed counts on1000 fixed TRAIN cells. No held-out truth is used for NB convergence or feature selection.

## Pseudospots
DEV9120 spots, TEST8400 spots; all use scoped cells from their own held-out split. The fixed simulation draws include593 of634 eligible DEV K32 and all253 eligible TEST K32. The41 unsampled DEV K32 all belong to HRA003620_BC-04; they remain eligible frozen members and are not relabeled or retrospectively excluded. Full member-level simulation use and per-source coverage are exported. N0=20 is a historical model/simulation condition, not verified nuclei counts. Each feasible same-sample×condition has10 repeats; same cells may appear in multiple spots, but never twice in one spot. Full memberships and reuse are recorded. TME cells are sampled from that same source with rejection until at least two available non-epithelial subtypes are represented. No cross-source mixtures or TRAIN borrowing.

S1: epithelial cells5/10/16, distinct K32 counts0/1/2/round(E/2)/E. S2: zero K32, same epithelial counts filled from frozen C14,C7,C17,UCell-high non-K32,NMF-high non-K32 pools; all are Epi_other. S3:20 epithelial cells with K32=0/1/2/10/20. S4:K32=5,epithelial=10, other/background cell identities held fixed within replicate; K32 cells are sampled from below vs above the within-source frozen K32 UCell median. This diagnostic does not redefine K32. Unsupported conditions are recorded, not imputed.

Depth targets {sim['depth_targets_full_RNA_UMI']} are equal-section medians of actual63-section raw UMI quartiles. Thinning probability=min(1,target/full pre-thinning UMI). Every UMI in selected genes is thinned by binomial draws; unmodeled remainder UMI is separately thinned for complete depth/RNA bookkeeping. No counts are amplified and cell number is fixed. Cell count truth stays positive if that cell contributes no retained RNA. Paired references use the exact same pseudospot files.

## Mapping and posterior
True cell2location Cell2location spatial mapping uses31 TRAIN-only signatures, N_cells_per_location20,detection_alpha20,lr0.002,train_size1,batch_sizeNone. Batch is actual sample only; no scenario, depth label, K32 count, proportion or truth covariate enters the model. A64-DEV-spot,50epoch/16draw technical smoke check precedes full DEV. Formal initial3000epochs then2000-epoch extensions to historical cap30000; loss plateau rule is relative change between final500 and preceding500 means<0.005. The initial loss-only plateau at3000epochs failed a DEV abundance-stability diagnostic: after5000epochs, median relative posterior-mean changes were24.7% for K32 and32.7% for Epi_other. That3000epoch stage is archived and excluded from final evaluation. Before TEST, the rule was amended to require both loss plateau and stable posterior means across consecutive training segments for Epi_K32,Epi_other and their sum: median absolute relative change<5%,95th percentile<20%, denominator=(previous mean+0.1), using256 diagnostic draws; minimum5000epochs and unchanged cap30000. The same truth-blind rule applies to both references and both splits. Actual epochs, abundance convergence history and the DEV amendment are exported. No TEST recovery result selects an epoch or setting. DEV settings and threshold were frozen before any TEST mapping. Actual convergence and reconstruction are retained separately from biological performance.

Each formal map has1000 variational-posterior w_sf draws, saved alone as .npy with recoverable model/config. Mean,median,q05,q95 are exported for every subtype. Epithelial total and K32/(K32+Epi_other) are formed within each draw before summarizing. Ratios with epithelial denominator<0.1 in more than5% of draws are flagged unstable; invalid draws are NA. No q05 sums or q05 ratios. Positive-only90% K32 interval coverage is reported separately: a continuous positive abundance prior does not assign exact zero, so interval exclusion of zero is not a detection rule and all-spot coverage is boundary-sensitive. Empirical negative-control FPR uses the DEV mean-abundance threshold. Mapping reconstruction uses posterior mean parameters on256 fixed spots and does not use abundance truth.

## DEV threshold and evaluation
Unified threshold={frozen['threshold_on_posterior_mean']}; strict posterior mean>threshold defines detection. For each of seven DEV zero-K32 background strata, source groups receive equal total weight; compute a95th weighted quantile then use the maximum across strata. Thus easy negatives cannot dilute difficult backgrounds. Actual achieved DEV FPR per stratum is saved. The same threshold applies to both references on TEST. q05>0 is never used as positivity.

Quantities: mean/median count MAE,RMSE,bias,slope/intercept,auxiliary Spearman; Epi_other and total epithelial errors; draw-wise fractions; negative distributions/FPR; count×depth×epithelial composition detection; paired reference differences; state-intensity paired effects. Overall and subgroup metrics give equal total weight to each source sample. Per-sample and conservative-group results are retained. Conditional rates average equally over samples with the relevant denominator: negative spots for FPR, positive spots for recall, and detected spots for precision; undefined per-source precision is omitted rather than set to zero. Spearman correlation is an auxiliary pooled-spot descriptive statistic. No narrow pseudo-replicate confidence interval is reported. State-intensity exploratory signed-rank uses source-group means only when exact-test prerequisites hold and at least3 groups exist; these are unverified source groups, not confirmed independent patients. Simulated positive prevalence is reported alongside precision/recall and is not real spatial prevalence.

## Reproducibility and limits
Master seed123; deterministic purpose-specific SHA256-derived seeds are recorded, with identical paired-reference seeds. Inputs, cells, labels, splits, genes, settings, signatures and pseudospots have hashes. Sparse counts are cached; no full gene×cell dense matrix is materialized. Limited minibatches/reconstruction subsets may be dense as required by NB likelihood. Models share one GPU under the later explicit user authorization for resource-aware concurrency; the exact scheduling override is recorded in RUNTIME_CONCURRENCY_OVERRIDE.md. Output stays in scope_frozen_resume_v1; historical results remain read-only.

K32 comes from the full historical discovery set. This is transfer/mixture recovery of a frozen candidate, not independently rediscovered labels. Pseudospots do not reproduce all scRNA-to-Visium platform effects. K32 abundance is not all MP10-high abundance. Conclusions first apply to this frozen scope and simulation conditions. No classifier, NMF/UCell/PCA/Harmony/clustering/UMAP rerun, CNV/prognosis/CellChat/niche or real spatial fit was performed. Training success and identifiability judgement are distinct.
'''
(R/'METHODS.md').write_text(methods)
